# Writing content

Full checklist: `src/data/writing-articles/README.md`.

## Pipeline

1. **Index row** — `src/data/writing.ts` (`writingColumns`). Stable kebab-case `id`, year, title, kind, excerpt.
2. **Article body** — `src/data/writing-articles/index.json` keyed by the **same** `id`.
3. **Images** — put files in `src/assets/home-assets/`; in JSON use `"src": "filename.jpg"` only. `writingArticles.ts` resolves URLs via `import.meta.glob` — never hand-edit `url`.
4. UI — click row opens `WritingEditor` (`articleId`); no expand. Dim-page toggle is toolbar brightness.

## Blocks schema

```json
{ "type": "p", "text": "..." }
{ "type": "image", "src": "hero4.jpg", "alt": "...", "caption": "optional" }
```

Article object: `id`, `title`, `kind`, `year`, `excerpt`, `blocks[]`. Keep list excerpt and JSON excerpt in sync when both exist.

## Do / don't

- ✅ Same `id` in `writing.ts` and `index.json`
- ✅ Filename-only image `src` under `home-assets`
- ❌ Don't invent a CMS or edit resolved `url` fields
- ❌ Don't put full article copy only in `writing.ts` — bodies belong in JSON
